    "description": {
      "value": "<h2>Penultimate Rites</h2><p><em>If you can’t save them, you can at least keep them here.</em></p><hr /><h3>Rules</h3><p>When a creature you can reach drops to 0 Integrity, you may use your reaction to stabilize it. If you do, it also gains temporary Integrity equal to your rank bonus.</p><p>Once you use this principle, you can’t use it again until you finish a Scene Break or Soma Break.</p><p class=\"ft-engine-note\"><em>🃏 Card — reaction, once per Scene Break; target the fallen ally: stabilized, with temporary Integrity equal to your rank bonus.</em></p>",
